<title>JAPAN: Kokusai Electric files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Kokusai Electric files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kokusai Electric Co Ltd, a maker of information equipment, said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 20 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration would be effective for two years from June 17, it said.</p>
